   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "For each thing a person (or the worker) does: who can, what it needs, the request, the permission rule, the server\nlogic, the tables it touches, and what it leaves in the audit log. Companion to architecture.excalidraw.",
   "originalText": "For each thing a person (or the worker) does: who can, what it needs, the request, the permission rule, the server\nlogic, the tables it touches, and what it leaves in the audit log. Companion to architecture.excalidraw.",
