   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "React 19.3 · react-router 8.5\nAnt Design 6.7, restyled (theme.ts)\nTypeScript 7.0 (tsc --noEmit)\nVite 8.3 dev server :5173 + /api proxy\n@fontsource Inter Tight\n  bundled, works offline\nstate: useApi() + useState, no Redux\nfetch() with X-User-Id header",
   "originalText": "React 19.3 · react-router 8.5\nAnt Design 6.7, restyled (theme.ts)\nTypeScript 7.0 (tsc --noEmit)\nVite 8.3 dev server :5173 + /api proxy\n@fontsource Inter Tight\n  bundled, works offline\nstate: useApi() + useState, no Redux\nfetch() with X-User-Id header",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 14,
