   "text": "Python 3.12 · FastAPI 0.165\nuvicorn 0.54 (ASGI server, --reload)\nDepends(): connection + current user\npython-multipart: file uploads\npsycopg 3.3: plain SQL, dict rows,\n  Jsonb, transactions + savepoints\nDecimal ROUND_HALF_UP for tax / FX\nno ORM · no auth server · no LLM",
   "originalText": "Python 3.12 · FastAPI 0.165\nuvicorn 0.54 (ASGI server, --reload)\nDepends(): connection + current user\npython-multipart: file uploads\npsycopg 3.3: plain SQL, dict rows,\n  Jsonb, transactions + savepoints\nDecimal ROUND_HALF_UP for tax / FX\nno ORM · no auth server · no LLM",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
