   "text": "same Docker image as the api\npoppler 25.03: pdftotext -layout,\n  pdftoppm (scan page → 300 dpi PNG)\nTesseract 5.5 OCR, eng + fra,\n  page modes 3, 4, 6 (3 passes)\nPython re: labelled regexes\ndifflib.SequenceMatcher: vendor names\nloop: claim → process → sleep 1 s",
   "originalText": "same Docker image as the api\npoppler 25.03: pdftotext -layout,\n  pdftoppm (scan page → 300 dpi PNG)\nTesseract 5.5 OCR, eng + fra,\n  page modes 3, 4, 6 (3 passes)\nPython re: labelled regexes\ndifflib.SequenceMatcher: vendor names\nloop: claim → process → sleep 1 s",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
