   "text": "PostgreSQL 17.12\nBIGINT cents · NUMERIC rates\nJSONB: fields, confidence, audit diff\nBYTEA: the uploaded files\nFOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED: job queue\nplpgsql trigger: audit append-only\nsequences: AP-00427, PAY-00416…\nDEFERRABLE FKs (users ↔ departments)",
   "originalText": "PostgreSQL 17.12\nBIGINT cents · NUMERIC rates\nJSONB: fields, confidence, audit diff\nBYTEA: the uploaded files\nFOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED: job queue\nplpgsql trigger: audit append-only\nsequences: AP-00427, PAY-00416…\nDEFERRABLE FKs (users ↔ departments)",
