   "text": "pytest 9.2 + FastAPI TestClient\nscratch databases: ap_test, ap_traps\n  (seeded fresh every run)\nap_traps: inbox sorted + worker ran\n  for real, then 50 trap tests\neach test = one transaction, rolled back\n  (API transactions → savepoints)\n100 tests · make traps prints CAUGHT",
   "originalText": "pytest 9.2 + FastAPI TestClient\nscratch databases: ap_test, ap_traps\n  (seeded fresh every run)\nap_traps: inbox sorted + worker ran\n  for real, then 50 trap tests\neach test = one transaction, rolled back\n  (API transactions → savepoints)\n100 tests · make traps prints CAUGHT",
